# @b87/tanstack-tw-table Usage Guide

## Entry Points

1. **`DataTable`** (Simple) - Batteries-included, auto-detects columns from metadata
2. **`DataTableCore`** (Advanced) - Requires `useDataTable` hook, manual column extraction
3. **`useDataTable` hook** (Headless) - Full control, use with `DataTableCore`

## Client-Side vs Server-Side

**Client-Side** (`mode: "client"`):
- Dataset < 10k rows, static data, instant filtering
- Use `DataTable` component
- Auto-detects columns from `column.meta`
- **REQUIRED:** Set `server.mode: "client"` or filters/sorting won't work

**Server-Side** (`manualPagination/Sorting/Filtering: true`):
- Dataset > 10k rows, dynamic data, server queries
- Use `DataTableCore` with `useDataTable` hook
- Use `useServerQuery` for query building
- **REQUIRED:** Set `urlSync: false` (conflicts with API params)

## Client-Side Pattern

```tsx
import { DataTable } from "@b87/tanstack-tw-table";
import { createNextRouter } from "@b87/tanstack-tw-table/routing";

// Column metadata auto-detection (RECOMMENDED)
const columns: ColumnDef<User>[] = [
  {
    accessorKey: "name",
    header: "Name",
    meta: { searchable: true }, // ✅ Auto-detected
  },
  {
    accessorKey: "status",
    header: "Status",
    meta: {
      filterable: {
        options: [{ label: "Active", value: "active" }],
      },
    }, // ✅ Auto-detected
  },
];

<DataTable
  data={users}
  columns={columns}
  pageCount={Math.ceil(users.length / 10)}
  tableId="users-table"
  router={createNextRouter()} // Optional: for URL sync
  features={{
    urlSync: true,
    viewManagement: true,
  }}
  server={{
    mode: "client", // ⚠️ CRITICAL: Required for client-side operations
  }}
/>
```

**Key Points:**
- `DataTable` auto-detects from `column.meta` - don't pass `searchableColumns`/`filterableColumns`
- Only extract manually if using `DataTableCore`: `extractSearchableColumns(columns)`

## Server-Side Pattern

```tsx
"use client";

import { useState, useCallback, useEffect, useMemo } from "react";
import type { ColumnDef, ColumnFiltersState, SortingState, PaginationState } from "@tanstack/react-table";
import { DataTableCore, useDataTable, useServerQuery } from "@b87/tanstack-tw-table";
import { extractSearchableColumns, extractFilterableColumns } from "@b87/tanstack-tw-table";

export function ServerSideTable() {
  const [users, setUsers] = useState<User[]>([]);
  const [pageCount, setPageCount] = useState(0);
  const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState(false);

  // Query building hook
  const { buildQuery, processServerResponse } = useServerQuery<User>({
    searchableColumns: ["name", "email"], // Array of keys
    enableQueryBuilder: true,
  });

  // State Injection Pattern: Callbacks receive complete state
  const fetchData = useCallback(async (tableState: {
    columnFilters?: ColumnFiltersState;
    sorting?: SortingState;
    globalFilter?: string;
    pagination?: PaginationState;
  }) => {
    setIsLoading(true);
    try {
      const queryParams = buildQuery(
        tableState.columnFilters || [],
        tableState.sorting || [],
        tableState.globalFilter,
        tableState.pagination
      );
      const response = await fetch(`/api/users?${queryParams.toString()}`);
      const result = await response.json();

      processServerResponse(result);
      setUsers(result.data);
      setPageCount(result.pagination?.totalPages || 1);
    } finally {
      setIsLoading(false);
    }
  }, [buildQuery, processServerResponse]);

  const columns = useMemo<ColumnDef<User>[]>(() => [
    { accessorKey: "name", header: "Name", meta: { searchable: true } },
    // ... more columns
  ], []);

  const { table } = useDataTable({
    data: users,
    columns,
    pageCount,
    tableId: "server-table",
    manualPagination: true,  // ⚠️ REQUIRED
    manualSorting: true,     // ⚠️ REQUIRED
    manualFiltering: true,   // ⚠️ REQUIRED
    urlSync: false,          // ⚠️ REQUIRED: Disable for server-side
    // State Injection: Use complete state from callbacks
    onSortingChange: async ({ sorting, state, resetPagination }) => {
      await fetchData({
        ...state,
        sorting,
        pagination: resetPagination
          ? { pageIndex: 0, pageSize: state.pagination.pageSize }
          : state.pagination,
      });
    },
    onFilterChange: async ({ columnFilters, globalFilter, state }) => {
      await fetchData({
        ...state,
        columnFilters,
        globalFilter,
        pagination: { pageIndex: 0, pageSize: state.pagination.pageSize }, // Reset pagination
      });
    },
    onPaginationChange: async ({ pagination, state }) => {
      await fetchData({ ...state, pagination });
    },
  });

  useEffect(() => {
    fetchData({ columnFilters: [], sorting: [], globalFilter: "", pagination: { pageIndex: 0, pageSize: 10 } });
  }, []);

  return (
    <DataTableCore
      table={table}
      columns={columns}
      searchableColumns={extractSearchableColumns(columns)}
      filterableColumns={extractFilterableColumns(columns)}
      isLoading={isLoading}
    />
  );
}
```

## Critical Patterns

### State Injection Pattern (Server-Side)

**✅ ALWAYS DO:** Use complete state from callbacks:

```tsx
onSortingChange: async ({ sorting, state, resetPagination }) => {
  // state already contains: columnFilters, sorting, pagination, globalFilter
  await fetchData({ ...state, sorting });
}
```

**❌ NEVER DO:** Access table state manually (causes stale closures):

```tsx
onSortingChange: async ({ sorting }) => {
  const state = table.getState(); // ❌ BAD
  await fetchData({ sorting, ...state });
}
```

### Column Metadata Pattern

**✅ ALWAYS DO:** Define in `column.meta` for auto-detection:

```tsx
const columns: ColumnDef<User>[] = [
  {
    accessorKey: "name",
    header: "Name",
    meta: { searchable: true }, // ✅ Auto-detected
  },
];
```

**❌ NEVER DO:** Use type assertions (defeats type safety):

```tsx
{ id: "name" as keyof User, title: "Name" } // ❌ BAD
```

### Reset Pagination on Filter/Sort Changes

**✅ ALWAYS DO:** Reset to page 0 when filters/sorting change:

```tsx
onFilterChange: async ({ columnFilters, globalFilter, state }) => {
  await fetchData({
    ...state,
    columnFilters,
    globalFilter,
    pagination: { pageIndex: 0, pageSize: state.pagination.pageSize }, // ✅ Reset
  });
}
```

