## Common Mistakes & Fixes

| Problem | Solution |
|---------|----------|
| Filters don't work (client-side) | Add `server.mode: "client"` |
| URL sync conflicts (server-side) | Set `urlSync: false` |
| Stale closures in callbacks | Use state injection pattern, don't call `table.getState()` |
| TypeScript errors on column IDs | Use `column.meta` instead of type assertions |
| Pagination stays on wrong page after filter | Reset to `pageIndex: 0` in `onFilterChange` |
| Missing columns in search/filter | Add `meta: { searchable: true }` or `meta: { filterable: {...} }` |

